    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When called, his body becomes enshrouded in a lump of darkness and can move among the tree shadows. From those shadows he stretches pale bony hands with huge joints and long dark purple nails to kill.",
        "chapters": [
          75
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When he retreats, he again turns into a lump of dark shadow with sharply raised silent speed.",
        "chapters": [
          76
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Flash Blink Gu is its complete counter. Once darkness is dispelled by that light, rank two Shadow Follower Gu needs three hours of rest before it can be used again. Its lurking abilities are very strong, but it also has a great weakness.",
